<title>USA: Vans said its board amends rights plan.</title>
<headline>Vans said its board amends rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vans Inc said its board of directors amended Vans' stockholder rights plan which was originally adopted in February 1994.</p>
<p>The Amended Plan extends the original Plan to February 22, 2007 and sets the purchase price of each preferred stock purchase right associated with each share of Vans common stock at $65.00.</p>
</text>
